  "description": "We often hide our darkest thoughts, pain, and fears deep in the unreachable corner of our psyche. We choose to ignore things that make us uneasy, since by doing so it makes life easier to live. But are you willing to take the chance and face them? See the world through the eyes of those who choose to challenge human values and beliefs, and unveil life's ugly sides. | \nTrigger Warning: This comic deals with sensitive subjects such as self-harm, suicide, and child abuse. (18+)\n\n- Webtoons",
